    {
      "id": "q10",
      "type": "short-text",
      "prompt": "$P$ is the point $(-2, 9)$ and $Q$ is the point $(4, -3)$. Find the equation of the line $PQ$. Give your answer in the form $ax + by + c = 0$ where $a$, $b$ and $c$ are integers.",
